---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Guides', url: '/guides/' }];

const guides = (await getCollection('guides')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const featured = guides.filter((g) => g.data.featured);

const topics = [
  'When someone dies',
  'Money and paperwork',
  'Choosing a funeral',
  'Planning ahead',
  'Grief and support',
] as const;
---

<Page
  title="Guides to Funerals in Scotland — John Bald, Dunbar"
  heading="Guides"
  description="Plain-language guides to funerals in Scotland: what to do when someone dies, registering a death, funeral costs, Funeral Support Payment, funeral plans and more."
  standfirst="Written for families in the east of Scotland, and free for anyone to use — including if you are arranging a funeral with someone else."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  wide={true}
>
  <div class="prose-jb">
    <p>
      Most of what families need is not really about funerals. It is about which office,
      which form, which fee, and who to telephone. Scotland does several of these things
      differently from England and Wales, and generic advice written for England is a
      common source of confusion here.
    </p>
    <p>
      So these are specific to Scotland, and where it matters, specific to East Lothian
      and the Borders.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-14">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl">Start here</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        featured.map((guide) => (
          <li class="flex flex-col border border-poppy bg-poppy-tint p-6">
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-muted">
              {guide.data.topic}
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl">
              <a href={`/guides/${guide.id}/`} class="no-underline hover:underline">
                {guide.data.title}
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-ink-soft">{guide.data.standfirst}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>

  {
    topics.map((topic) => {
      const inTopic = guides.filter((g) => g.data.topic === topic);
      if (inTopic.length === 0) return null;
      return (
        <section class="mt-14">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl">{topic}</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
            {inTopic.map((guide) => (
              <li class="border-b border-line pb-5">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-xl">
                  <a href={`/guides/${guide.id}/`} class="no-underline hover:underline">
                    {guide.data.title}
                  </a>
                </h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-ink-soft">{guide.data.standfirst}</p>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>
      );
    })
  }

  <div class="prose-jb mt-16">
    <h2>Looking for something specific?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/directory/">Crematoria, cemeteries and registrars</a> across the east of
        Scotland
      </li>
      <li><a href="/bereavement-support/">Bereavement support and helplines</a></li>
      <li><a href="/funeral-costs/">Our own prices</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If what you need is not here, telephone{' '}
      <a href={CONTACT.phoneHref} class="font-semibold">{CONTACT.phone}</a> and ask. We
      would rather answer the question than have you not find it — and if it comes up
      more than once, we will write it up.
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>
